---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title={"Environ facials in South Ealing | Life Spa London"} description={"Environ vitamin A facials at Life Spa London, South Ealing, from £85. A skin plan built step by step, with a home-care routine made for you."} style={1} page="environ">
<main id="main">

  <!-- 1. Hero -->
  <section class="hero hero--service" aria-label="Environ facials">
    <video autoplay muted loop playsinline preload="metadata" aria-hidden="true">
      <source src="assets/environ-hero.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <div class="wrap hero-content">
      <p class="crumbs"><a href="index.html#offer">Treatments</a> / <a href="#">Facials &amp; Skin</a> / Environ</p>
      <h1>Environ facials</h1>
      <p class="sub">Vitamin-rich facials from Environ, the skincare brand founded by plastic surgeon Dr Des Fernandes. We build vitamin A into your skin step by step, for results that last.</p>
      <ul class="facts">
        <li>From £85</li><li>60 min</li><li>A home-care plan made for you</li>
      </ul>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn btn--light" href="#">Book Environ</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost-light" href="#prices">See prices</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 2. How Environ works -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose has-img">
      <h2>How Environ works</h2>
      <p>Vitamin A is essential for healthy skin, but skin needs time to get used to it. Environ's Vitamin STEP-UP System™ raises the level gradually, so your skin gets stronger without irritation. Your therapist sets your starting point and moves you up as your skin is ready.</p>
      <figure class="prose-img"><img src="assets/environ-treatment.jpg" alt="Environ facial treatment" loading="lazy"></figure>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 3. Journey -->
  <section class="section section--tint" aria-labelledby="steps-h">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head"><h2 id="steps-h">Your Environ journey</h2></div>
      <div class="steps three">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="6.5"/><path d="M16 16l4.5 4.5"/></svg></div>
          <span class="n">Step 1</span>
          <h3>Find your step</h3>
          <p>A skin assessment sets the vitamin A level your skin is ready for.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 20L16 8"/><path d="M14 4l1 2.5 2.5 1-2.5 1L14 11l-1-2.5-2.5-1 2.5-1z"/><path d="M19 13l.6 1.4L21 15l-1.4.6L19 17l-.6-1.4L17 15l1.4-.6z"/></svg></div>
          <span class="n">Step 2</span>
          <h3>Treat</h3>
          <p>Your facial or Cool Peel uses Environ's Ionzyme® DF device, which uses sound waves and a gentle ionic current to push vitamins deeper.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="ico"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 20h5v-4h5v-4h5V8h3"/><path d="M3 20h18"/></svg></div>
          <span class="n">Step 3</span>
          <h3>Step up</h3>
          <p>You use Environ at home and move up the STEP-UP System™ as your skin gets stronger.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 4. Why clients choose it + how it compares -->
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap suits">
      <div>
        <h2>Why clients choose it</h2>
        <ul class="ticks">
          <li>Targets fine lines, sun damage, pigmentation, dehydration and redness</li>
          <li>Results build over time, rather than fading after a week</li>
          <li>A plan built for your skin, with home care that works with your facials</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="compare">
        <h3>How it compares</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Choose Environ</strong> for lasting change in ageing, sun damage or pigmentation.</li>
          <li><strong>Choose HydraFacial instead</strong> for an instant glow and clear pores.</li>
          <li><strong>Choose Dermalogica instead</strong> for a shorter facial tailored to breakouts or sensitivity, from £60.</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="link-arrow" href="#">Compare all our facials</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 5. Treatments and prices -->
  <section class="section section--tint" id="prices">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:900px">
      <div class="section-head"><h2>Treatments and prices</h2></div>

      <h3 class="group-title">Essential Facial Collection</h3>
      <p class="group-note">Vitamin facials, tailored to your skin.</p>
      <div class="accordion">
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e1" id="eb1"><span class="acc-title">Essential Youth Reset</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£95</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e1" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb1"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>A power collagen facial that smooths fine lines and restores firmness. Best for premature ageing, sun damage and loss of firmness.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e2" id="eb2"><span class="acc-title">Essential Moisture Boost</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£95</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e2" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb2"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Hydrates with hyaluronic acid and vitamins, and strengthens the skin barrier. Best for dehydrated, tight or stressed skin.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e3" id="eb3"><span class="acc-title">Essential Comfort Calm</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£95</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e3" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb3"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Reduces visible redness and restores balance. Best for sensitive or reactive skin.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e4" id="eb4"><span class="acc-title">Essential Radiance Reveal</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£95</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e4" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb4"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Brightens and evens skin tone with vitamin A and antioxidants. Best for pigmentation, uneven tone and dullness.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="group-title">Cool Peels</h3>
      <p class="group-note">Gentle, non-invasive peels.</p>
      <div class="accordion">
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e5" id="eb5"><span class="acc-title">Youth Renew Cool Peel</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£85</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e5" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb5"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Softens the look of fine lines and sun damage. Best for ageing and uneven skin.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e6" id="eb6"><span class="acc-title">Moisture Boost Cool Peel</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£85</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e6" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb6"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Buffs and revives dry, tired skin, with no visible peeling. Suitable all year round.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e7" id="eb7"><span class="acc-title">Deep Cleansing Cool Peel</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£85</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e7" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb7"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Purifies and helps control congestion. Best for breakout-prone skin.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e8" id="eb8"><span class="acc-title">Bright Recovery Cool Peel</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£85</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e8" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb8"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>A lactic acid peel that fades the look of sun-related unevenness.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e9" id="eb9"><span class="acc-title">Vibrant-C Micro Peel</span><span class="acc-time">60 min</span><span class="acc-price">£85</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e9" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb9"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Concentrated vitamin C, freshly mixed for you, for a more even tone and texture. Best for sun-damaged, pigmented or mature skin.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h3 class="group-title">Add-on</h3>
      <div class="accordion">
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="e10" id="eb10"><span class="acc-title">Sonic &amp; Ultrasonic Exfoliation</span><span class="acc-time">15 min</span><span class="acc-price">£20</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="e10" role="region" aria-labelledby="eb10"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>A sonic brush deep-cleans, then ultrasonic exfoliation lifts dead skin, helping your skin absorb the Environ actives.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 6. Real results -->
  <section class="section" id="results">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head"><h2>Real results</h2></div>
      <div class="ba-grid">
        <figure class="ba" style="margin:0">
          <div class="ba-box">
            <img src="assets/environ-face-after.jpg" alt="Skin after Environ treatment" loading="lazy">
            <img class="ba-before" src="assets/environ-face-before.jpg" alt="Skin before Environ treatment" loading="lazy">
            <span class="ba-label b">Before</span><span class="ba-label a">After</span>
            <div class="ba-handle"></div>
            <input class="ba-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Drag to compare before and after">
          </div>
          <figcaption>Environ facial: face</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <figure class="ba" style="margin:0">
          <div class="ba-box">
            <img src="assets/environ-b.webp" alt="Neck skin after Environ treatment" loading="lazy">
            <img class="ba-before" src="assets/environ-a.webp" alt="Neck skin before Environ treatment" loading="lazy">
            <span class="ba-label b">Before</span><span class="ba-label a">After</span>
            <div class="ba-handle"></div>
            <input class="ba-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Drag to compare before and after">
          </div>
          <figcaption>Environ facial: neck</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <!-- Stand-in slider: replace assets/demo-result-3.jpg with a real Environ before/after pair. -->
        <figure class="ba" style="margin:0">
          <div class="ba-box">
            <img src="assets/demo-result-3.jpg" alt="Skin after treatment" loading="lazy">
            <img class="ba-before demo" src="assets/demo-result-3.jpg" alt="Skin before treatment" loading="lazy">
            <span class="ba-label b">Before</span><span class="ba-label a">After</span>
            <div class="ba-handle"></div>
            <input class="ba-range" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="50" aria-label="Drag to compare before and after">
          </div>
          <figcaption>Environ facial results</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 7. Before you book -->
  <section class="section section--tint" id="before-you-book">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:860px">
      <div class="section-head"><h2>Before you book</h2></div>
      <div class="accordion">
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="c1" id="cb1"><span class="acc-title">Is Environ right for me?</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="c1" role="region" aria-labelledby="cb1"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Our Environ facials use the Ionzyme® DF device. Please tell us before booking if you have: a skin infection or cold sores; very sensitive, allergy-prone or highly vascular skin; inflamed, swollen or sunburnt skin; a pacemaker; pregnancy; epilepsy; porphyria; multiple sclerosis; open cuts or wounds; metal pins or plates in the face, or many metal fillings; or ear problems such as tinnitus, infections or hearing implants (a doctor's consent is needed). Please also wait two weeks after Botox or fillers.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="c2" id="cb2"><span class="acc-title">Do I need to use Environ at home?</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="c2" role="region" aria-labelledby="cb2"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>It's not required, but it gives the best results. Your therapist will recommend the right products and step for you.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="acc-item">
          <button class="acc-btn" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="c3" id="cb3"><span class="acc-title">Can I combine Environ with HydraFacial or CACI?</span><span class="acc-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
          <div class="acc-panel" id="c3" role="region" aria-labelledby="cb3"><div><div class="acc-body"><p>Yes, with the right timing. Your therapist will plan it with you.</p></div></div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 8. Book -->
  <section class="cta" id="book">
    <div class="wrap cta-split">
      <figure class="cta-img"><img src="assets/facials.webp" alt="Client relaxing during a facial" loading="lazy"></figure>
      <div class="cta-body">
        <h2>Start your skin plan</h2>
        <div class="btn-row">
        <a class="btn" href="#">Book Environ</a>
        <a class="btn btn--ghost-light" href="tel:+442085675159">Call 020 8567 5159</a>
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</main>
</Base>
